{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/e3bf77efaab6275287e9a758262f0136.webp?t=1772989139\" width=616 height=48 /></span>Draw your cards. Plant your crops. Cast your spells. Pay the tribute. Survive the cycle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been chosen - or cursed - by a mysterious divine entity. Their arcane magic shifts the rules. Channel these powers to find synergies between all the different cards (Crops, Buildings, Animals, Arcane), create complex products, and reap the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/45698f29e3d31e34a7e2026679c69bd7.poster.avif?t=1772989139\" width=616 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/45698f29e3d31e34a7e2026679c69bd7.webm?t=1772989139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/25f4e2c205a5fe9178417c430eb67f93.webp?t=1772989139\" width=616 height=48 /></span>When life gives you crops and magic... make jalape\u00f1o hotdogs!.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/df52cad333c276dd51fb610f36d1aa4c.poster.avif?t=1772989139\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/df52cad333c276dd51fb610f36d1aa4c.webm?t=1772989139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/3f054b8eeb6924e71c62930d7c660948.webp?t=1772989139\" width=616 height=48 /></span>Mutators = Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dozens of world affecting mutators, dramatically alter game rules, creating fresh challenges and hilarious chaos every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/943e99d31a72b175a5beb12d43af5527.webp?t=1772989139\" width=616 height=48 /></span>A Loyal Companion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone. A clever companion is at your bidding - offering help, and occasionally unleashing destruction and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/9065971b8cf1329054aba49c05889289.poster.avif?t=1772989139\" width=616 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/extras/9065971b8cf1329054aba49c05889289.webm?t=1772989139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703910?t=1772989139","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703910?t=1772989139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/def89b0b0eb8942f3ec3220e54b2c0a44d70f260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772989139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703910/def89b0b0eb8942f3ec3220e54b2c0a44d70f260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772989139","categories":[{"description":"Singl